   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "Claim generators shall not include a dataSource field in assertion metadata."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p0/s3",
   "paragraph": "0",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "Validators shall continue to accept the field for backwards compatibility."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s1",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "Claim generators shall use the integer label 33 instead, as described in Section 13.5, “X.509 Certificates”."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s2",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "Validators shall continue to accept the string label x5chain for backwards compatibility."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s3",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "The type of the data shall be identified using the dc:format field, with a standard IANA media type."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s4",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "A data box shall have a label of c2pa.data and follows the rules of assertion labels with respect to multiple instances."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s5",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "A C2PA Data Box Store is a JUMBF superbox that shall contain only one or more CBOR Content Type boxes (cbor)."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s6",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "It shall not contain any other type of JUMBF box or superbox."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s7",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "It shall have a label of c2pa.databoxes and a JUMBF type UUID of 63326462-0011-0010-8000-00AA00389B71 (c2db)."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p22/s8",
   "paragraph": "22",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "The CBOR Content Type boxes shall have a label of c2pa.data (for data boxes)."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p21/s1",
   "paragraph": "21",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "Claim generators shall not use the c2pa.removed action."
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "INTL-c2pa-spec-2026:appendix-H/p21/s2",
   "paragraph": "21",
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
